  "body": "Renovated single-level home with exclusive-use sunny garden in one of the best streets on Auckland's North Shore!\r\n\r\nTucked away in Devonport, this beautifully renovated single-level two-bedroom brick and tile unit delivers far more than you would ever expect.\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned down the driveway, the home has been thoughtfully extended and renovated to create an impressive sense of space, light and everyday comfort. The result is a warm, stylish and incredibly easy-care residence with excellent indoor-outdoor flow and a large exclusive-use garden that gives the property a rare feeling of independence.\r\n\r\nNorth-facing decks and sun-soaked outdoor living make this a standout for those who value privacy, natural light and usable flat land. Whether you are entertaining, pottering in the garden, relaxing in the sun or simply enjoying the peace and quiet, this is a home that feels instantly inviting.\r\n\r\nConstructed in dependable brick and tile, and recently modernised to a high standard, it offers the kind of low-maintenance lifestyle downsizers, first-home buyers and investors are always searching for. There is no body corporate, each home has its own carport, and with only two residences on the 698m² site, the setting feels private, established and wonderfully secure.\r\n\r\nWith both units available for purchase, there is also a rare opportunity to secure one or explore the possibility of purchasing both. Either way, this is an astute property decision in one of Stanley Point's most tightly held locations.\r\n\r\nAffordable, private, sunny and beautifully presented, this is a rare Devonport Peninsula opportunity that will genuinely surprise and delight when you view.\r\n\r\nTo download property files, please go to: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/ZB6W",
